
***Buttons
$s=osnap
;

***pop1
Setup
[Load SETup]^c^c^p$p1=* (progn (initget "Yes No")+
(if (/= (getkword "Executar SETup (Yes/No)? ") "No")+
(progn (prompt "^JCarregando... ")(loadf "k1bc0")(c:setup)))(princ))
Yes
No
[~--]
[Reset Layers]^C^CSCRIPT LAYER
[Reset Vars]^C^CSCRIPT SETVAR
[~--]
[Regiao de Trabalho (AutoDWG)]^C^CAD_INSERT
[Etapa do Projeto (AutoPLOT) ]^C^CAP_ETPPROJ

***pop2
[Pontos]
[* PLANTA BAIXA *]
[~--]
[Registro de agua fria  ]^c^c^p(progn(if(/=(getvar"clayer")"H-PONTOS")(command"layer""m""H-pontos"""))(princ)) inserir H/H12c00 \\
[Registro de agua quente]^c^c^p(progn(if(/=(getvar"clayer")"H-PONTOS")(command"layer""m""H-pontos"""))(princ)) inserir H/H13c00 \\
[~--]
