(princ))

***pop6
[Setings]
[ORTHO]^o
[SNAP]^b
[~--]
[Box-1]'setvar pickbox 1 'setvar aperture 1
[Box-3]'setvar pickbox 3 'setvar aperture 3
[Angbase 0]'setvar angbase 0
[Angbase]'setvar angbase \
[Mirrtext ON/OFF]^c^c^p(progn+
(if (zerop (getvar "mirrtext"))+
(progn (setvar "mirrtext" 1) (prompt "<Mirrtext on>") (princ))+
(progn (setvar "mirrtext" 0) (prompt "<Mirrtext off>") (princ))))
[~--]
[Drawing Aids...]'ddrmodes

